OL,3,GNEWSAPalestinian couple and teenage
OL,4,Adaughter who died in water off Shoreham
OL,5,Anamed by police
OL,6,
OL,7,FSussex Police say the family lived in
OL,8,FLondon and travelled to Shoreham. The
OL,9,Fforce also says it is working with HM
OL,10,FCoroner "to understand exactly how this
OL,11,Fincident occurred"
OL,13,FThe forum says two other children were
OL,14,Fon the shore at the time of the
OL,15,Fincident and are now being cared for by
OL,16,Ftheir uncle
OL,18,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham calls it "a
OL,19,Freal terrible family tragedy" and warns
OL,20,Fabout "the dangers of open water
OL,21,Fswimming"
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
